    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">One place for the whole society</p>
      <h2>Everything your society now keeps in record books, WhatsApp groups and Excel.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="tour-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="What CoopCircle does">
      <button class="tour-tab active" id="tab-savings" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pane-savings" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pane-savings" aria-selected="true">{% icon "piggy-bank" %} Savings and dues</button>
      <button class="tour-tab" id="tab-loans" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pane-loans" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pane-loans" aria-selected="false">{% icon "cash-coin" %} Loans</button>
      <button class="tour-tab" id="tab-payments" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pane-payments" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pane-payments" aria-selected="false">{% icon "phone" %} Payments</button>
      <button class="tour-tab" id="tab-reports" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pane-reports" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pane-reports" aria-selected="false">{% icon "file-earmark-bar-graph" %} Reports</button>
      <button class="tour-tab" id="tab-app" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pane-app" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pane-app" aria-selected="false">{% icon "person-badge" %} Member app</button>
    </div>

    <div class="tab-content tour-panes">
      <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="pane-savings" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-savings" tabindex="0">
        <div class="tour-pane">
          <div class="tour-copy">
            <h3>Record every contribution once. The right people can see it.</h3>
            <ul class="check-list">
              <li>Savings with interest, target savings and regular savings plans.</li>
              <li>Dues, levies and funds charged on time. You can see who hasn’t paid.</li>
              <li>Branch staff record cash, transfer and POS payments, with the receipt.</li>
              <li>If your society wants, a leader checks each payment before it counts.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/product/savings/">More on savings and dues {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tour-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="ui-panel">
              <p class="ui-label">Monthly dues · November</p>
              <div class="ui-progress"><i style="--w: 78%"></i></div>
              <p class="ui-meta">142 of 182 members paid · ₦1,420,000 collected</p>
              <div class="ui-row"><span class="ui-avatar">AO</span><span><strong>Amaka O.</strong> · Savings deposit</span><b>₦20,000</b></div>
              <div class="ui-row"><span class="ui-avatar">KB</span><span><strong>Kunle B.</strong> · Monthly dues</span><b>₦10,000</b></div>
              <div class="ui-row"><span class="ui-avatar">FI</span><span><strong>Fatima I.</strong> · Building levy</span><b>₦5,000</b></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pane-loans" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-loans" tabindex="0">
        <div class="tour-pane">
          <div class="tour-copy">
            <h3>From the loan form to the last repayment, with no paper to collect.</h3>
            <ul class="check-list">
              <li>Members apply in the app, or staff apply for them. Documents go with the application.</li>
              <li>Guarantors read what they are agreeing to, and agree on their phone.</li>
              <li>Your own approval steps and loan limits. The member sees their repayment dates.</li>
              <li>A credit score for each member, based on how they have saved and repaid (Growth and up).</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/product/loans/">More on loans {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tour-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="ui-panel">
              <p class="ui-label">Loan application · ₦500,000 over 12 months</p>
              <ol class="ui-steps">
                <li class="done">Applied by the member</li>
                <li class="done">Guarantors signed (2 of 2)</li>
                <li class="now">Loan committee review</li>
                <li>President’s approval</li>
                <li>Paid to member</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pane-payments" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-payments" tabindex="0">
        <div class="tour-pane">
          <div class="tour-copy">
            <h3>Members pay from their phone, straight into your society’s bank account.</h3>
            <ul class="check-list">
              <li>Card or bank payments through Paystack, paid into your society’s own bank account.</li>
              <li>Or a bank transfer: the member adds the reference or a screenshot, and a leader checks it.</li>
              <li>The member sees the fee before paying, so the society gets the full amount.</li>
              <li>The money goes to the right savings, dues or loan, and the member gets a receipt.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/product/payments/">More on member payments {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tour-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="ui-panel ui-panel-narrow">
              <p class="ui-label">Pay into Main Savings</p>
              <p class="ui-figure-sm">₦10,000.00</p>
              <div class="ui-line"><span>Convenience fee</span><b>₦304.57</b></div>
              <div class="ui-line ui-line-total"><span>You pay</span><b>₦10,304.57</b></div>
              <span class="ui-button ui-button-block">Pay ₦10,304.57</span>
              <p class="ui-meta text-center mt-2">{% icon "lock" %} Secured by Paystack</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pane-reports" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-reports" tabindex="0">
        <div class="tour-pane">
          <div class="tour-copy">
            <h3>Reports ready for your next meeting.</h3>
            <ul class="check-list">
              <li>Member statements as a PDF, for any dates you choose.</li>
              <li>Reports on savings, loans, unpaid repayments, dues, cash hand-ins and expenses.</li>
              <li>On bigger plans: changes over 24 months, and each branch side by side.</li>
              <li>Download them as a PDF or a spreadsheet (CSV), or have them emailed to you regularly.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/product/reports/">More on reports {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tour-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="ui-panel">
              <p class="ui-label">Money in and out · last 6 months</p>
              <div class="ui-chart">
                <i style="--h: 48%"></i><i style="--h: 62%"></i><i style="--h: 55%"></i>
                <i style="--h: 70%"></i><i style="--h: 66%"></i><i style="--h: 84%"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="ui-chart-labels"><span>Jun</span><span>Jul</span><span>Aug</span><span>Sep</span><span>Oct</span><span>Nov</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pane-app" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-app" tabindex="0">
        <div class="tour-pane">
          <div class="tour-copy">
            <h3>Members can see their own accounts on their phone.</h3>
            <ul class="check-list">
              <li>Savings, dues, loans and shares. Amounts stay hidden until they enter their PIN.</li>
              <li>They can apply for loans and empowerment programmes, and answer guarantor requests.</li>
              <li>They get notices from the society, and a statement whenever they need one.</li>
              <li>The app shows your society’s own colours and logo.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/for/members/">More on Coop Member {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tour-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="ui-panel ui-panel-narrow">
              <p class="ui-label">Programmes open to you</p>
              <div class="ui-row"><span class="ui-avatar ui-avatar-green">{% icon "heart" %}</span><span><strong>Start-up Grants</strong><br><span class="ui-meta">Grant · up to ₦40,000</span></span></div>
              <div class="ui-row"><span class="ui-avatar ui-avatar-green">{% icon "tools" %}</span><span><strong>Skills Training</strong><br><span class="ui-meta">Training · closes 15 Dec</span></span></div>
              <span class="ui-button ui-button-block">Apply</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ── Who it's for ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -#}
<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Built for everyone in the society</p>
      <h2>Leaders, branch staff and members each get what they need.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <a class="audience-card" href="/for/leadership/">
          <span class="audience-icon">{% icon "bank" %}</span>
          <h3>Leadership</h3>
          <p>See funds, loans and every branch on one screen. Approve withdrawals and loans with your PIN. No money leaves the society until you approve it.</p>
          <span class="link-arrow">For presidents and executives {% icon "arrow-right" %}</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <a class="audience-card" href="/for/branch-staff/">
          <span class="audience-icon">{% icon "people" %}</span>
          <h3>Branch staff</h3>
          <p>Register members, record payments quickly and hand in the cash you collect. No more checking notebooks at the end of the month.</p>
          <span class="link-arrow">For secretaries and branch admins {% icon "arrow-right" %}</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <a class="audience-card" href="/for/members/">
          <span class="audience-icon">{% icon "person-badge" %}</span>
          <h3>Members</h3>
          <p>Check your balances, pay in, apply for a loan and follow every request. You don’t have to wait for the next meeting to ask.</p>
          <span class="link-arrow">For members {% icon "arrow-right" %}</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ── Getting started ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -#}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <div class="row g-5 align-items-start">
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <p class="eyebrow">Getting started</p>
        <h2>Start using it this week.</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-strong">There’s nothing to install and no long training. Your president signs up first, then invites everyone else.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary mt-2" href="{{ site.apps.signUp }}">Create your society</a>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">1</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Create your society</h3>
              <p>Your president registers the society and its first branch. Then they invite the executives and branch staff.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">2</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Bring in your members</h3>
              <p>Register members one by one. On Growth and up, you can also upload them with their balances from an Excel file.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">3</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Invite them to Coop Member</h3>
              <p>Members get an invitation by text message or email. They can see their own accounts from the first day.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ── Security ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -#}
<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <div class="row g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Safety</p>
        <h2>Made for money that belongs to all your members.</h2>
        <p class="lead-light">A cooperative runs on trust. CoopCircle builds the checks in your bye-laws into everyday work.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-light mt-2" href="/security/">How we keep it safe</a>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <div class="security-grid">
          <div>
            <span class="security-icon">{% icon "123" %}</span>
            <h3>A PIN on what matters</h3>
            <p>Approving, paying and cancelling all need the person’s own 4-digit PIN.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="security-icon">{% icon "people" %}</span>
            <h3>Someone else checks</h3>
            <p>Staff can’t pay their own loan to themselves or approve their own transfer.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="security-icon">{% icon "bank2" %}</span>
            <h3>Accounts checked with the bank</h3>
            <p>We confirm each bank account is in the owner’s name. A new account waits a short time before money can go to it.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="security-icon">{% icon "journal-text" %}</span>
            <h3>Every change recorded</h3>
            <p>Who did what, and when. On Professional and up, your leaders can read the full change history.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ── Pricing teaser ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -#}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <div class="section-head section-head-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
        <h2>Start free. Pay as your society grows.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/pricing/">Compare every plan {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      {%- for plan in plans %}{% if plan.code != "enterprise" %}
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="plan-card{% if plan.popular %} plan-card-popular{% endif %}">
          {%- if plan.popular %}<span class="plan-badge">Most popular</span>{% endif %}
          <h3>{{ plan.name }}</h3>
          <p class="plan-price">{{ plan.monthly | naira }}<span class="plan-per">{% if plan.monthly > 0 %} / month{% endif %}</span></p>
          <p class="plan-blurb">{{ plan.blurb }}</p>
          <ul class="plan-limits">
            <li>{{ plan.members }}</li>
            <li>{{ plan.staff }}</li>
            <li>{{ plan.branches }}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">Prices in naira. Pay for a year and get two months free. A larger society or a union? <a href="/contact/">Talk to us about Enterprise</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ── FAQ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -#}
<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <div class="row g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
        <h2>What societies ask us first.</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-strong">Something else? <a href="/help/">Visit the Help Center</a> or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="accordion faq" id="faq">
          {%- for f in faqs %}
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h3 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button{% if not loop.first %} collapsed{% endif %}" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-{{ loop.index }}" aria-expanded="{{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }}" aria-controls="faq-{{ loop.index }}">{{ f.q }}</button>
            </h3>
            <div id="faq-{{ loop.index }}" class="accordion-collapse collapse{% if loop.first %} show{% endif %}" data-bs-parent="#faq">
              <div class="accordion-body">{{ f.a }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for f in faqs %}
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ f.q | dump | safe }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ f.a | dump | safe }} } }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
